lability end-to-end flow and direct unauthorized private endpoint tests. Prerequisites F.\nH Local backup and verified restore. Outcome librarian can recover durable records on site, inferred from local-only constraint (proposal). Scope consistent full database backups, safe local export to approved in-building location, restore preview/confirmation and pre-restore recovery copy; installation and backup instructions. Excludes cloud sync. Acceptance backup includes tools/members/loans/access configuration as appropriate, restore recovers records and loan consistency, corrupt backup is rejected without altering live data. Behaviour clear failures and recovery instructions, local-only access to backup controls. Verification restore to isolated temporary local store and compare records; failure injection. Prerequisites F,B.\nI Verify shared-laptop release. Outcome both librarians can use complete flow offline safely, from all conversation requirements. Scope end-to-end checks, no runtime outbound traffic, no personal data in logs/repo/fixtures, start after laptop restart, member-mode privacy and keyboard usability, backup restore drill and short operating guide. Excludes deployment off premises. Acceptance demonstrate 120 synthetic tools/80 fictional members without asserting performance SLA; complete add/import/lend/due/return/browse/restore flow offline. Behaviour verify clear errors and recovery, access lock clears private display/cache. Verification end-to-end suite, network inspection and observed offline startup. Prerequisites G,H.\nJ Checkpoint: first-version acceptance. Criteria owner demonstrates adding tool, import preview, lending with due date, member availability without private details, return, overdue and local recovery; confirm privacy/offline operation. Artifact working app and guide. Depends I.\n\nCoverage: all user requirements map C-G,I,J; spreadsheet D; local-only C,H,I; no designs A/B; later reservations/email explicit deferrals.\nSetup writes afte